Description: Load the Armatos Forum window when it is installed
 Forum is Discover's engine with its own QML face. When
 /usr/share/armatos/forum/Forum.qml (or $FORUM_QML) exists it is loaded in
 place of the Kirigami DiscoverWindow; otherwise Discover behaves as upstream.
Author: Armatos <factionparadox@users.noreply.github.com>
Forwarded: not-needed

